DESCRIPTION:Team On Draft - Road Cycling\nWe're finally getting around to 
 posting a ride to one of the breweries in downtown Clayton. Several of you
  have suggested this as a ride\, and I'm pretty sure a few of you have rid
 den it with some group or other\, so I'd welcome any suggestions\, includi
 ng where to get off of the Neuse River Trail to head over to the brewery. 
 I think the NRT goes all the way to Clayton Municipal Park\, which is real
 ly close to [Deep River Brewing](http://www.deepriverbrewing.com)\, but pl
 ease let me know if I'm wrong about that.\n\nRight now the plan is to meet
  at Milburnie Park\, ride to Deep River\, hang out there for one beer\, an
 d then ride back. It'll be about 28.5 miles total. We'll go get lunch afte
 r that if anyone is hungry. I assume there are food trucks at the brewery\
 , too.
LAST-MODIFIED:20261122T144323Z
