DESCRIPTION:AI for the everyday professional Less overwhelm. More confiden
 ce. Smarter ways to work with AI. Featuring Erica Rooney Tuesday\, Decembe
 r 1\, 2026 9:00–10:30 a.m. Work smarter with AI Curious about how AI can
  make your workday easier? Join us for an engaging session exploring pract
 ical ways to use AI to boost productivity\, spark creativity\, and work mo
 re efficiently—no technical expertise required! Meet our speaker Erica R
 ooney is the founder of HER Collective\, a two-time author\, executive coa
 ch\, and North Carolina State Lead for Women Applying AI. She helps profes
 sionals harness AI to work smarter\, lead confidently\, and stay ahead in 
 an evolving workplace. Complimentary event open to women representing Wake
  Forest Area Chamber member businesses.
