 for everyone that comes out.\nPlease come early to sign required Harris La
 ke sign-in. Please fill out the yearly waiver below if you have not yet.\n
 Meet time: 6:00\nRide time: 6:15\nDistance: 8+ miles\nLocation: Harris Lak
 e County Park\nWhat to bring:\nBike in good working order\nHelmet\nCharged
  bike light\nHydration\n\nhttps://www.webscorer.com/register?raceid=415052
 \n\nWe will meet in the Cypress parking lot\, message me if you need direc
 tions. I drive a VW Passat\, ride a gold Specialized Levo SL and will setu
 p a table for sign-in.\n\nIf you aren't a TORC member please consider join
 ing. Funds go directly to support local trails. https://www.torc-nc.org/so
 rba/
