SUMMARY:ATC Tower Lighting
DESCRIPTION:Mark your calendars for this annual community event to kick off
  the holiday season and light the Lucky Strike Tower in coordination with 
 the WRAL Tower in Raleigh and Rocky Mount Mills Tower in Rocky Mount. This
  includes a live televised portion on WRAL with on-air personality Dan Hag
 gerty (and special guests) that leads right into the tree lighting at Rock
 efeller Center on NBC.\n\nThe Tower Stage will be hopping\, with Jeanne Jo
 lly &amp\; The Mistletoes kicking things off at 6pm\, and Durham's own Fus
 t playing us into the night at 7:15.\n\nWe'll have plenty of family-friend
 ly activities all night long\, including a photo booth\, Santa and his sle
 igh\, balloon makers and other activities at ATC retailers across campus. 
 And we'll be accepting new and gently used coats\, gloves and scarves to d
 onate to Fresh Start Durham.\n\nIt's free and open to the public\, so spre
 ad the word!
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://americantobacco.co/wp-content/uploads/20
 26/08/ATC-Flyer-1.jpg
