X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Gcal Cb2Ajgfjpk6Bf9Gifg6Kg2Hn1S": "https://www.meetup.com/torc-nc/events/317516344/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_cb2ajgfjpk6bf9gifg6kg2hn1s
SUMMARY:Beaver Dam Night Ride
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261203T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261203T193000
DTSTAMP:20261128T073139Z
UID:event_317516344@meetup.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20261203T173000
SEQUENCE:1
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261122T144338Z
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Off Road Cyclists (TORC)\nRSVP required via Meetup or
  email to Jbfiets@gmail.com\n\nThis will be a \\~1.5 hour night ride at Be
 aver Dam. Meet at the mountain bike trailhead parking lot around 5:30.\nWh
 at to bring:\n-Helmets are required\n-A good light+a backup or power bank\
 , enough for 1.5-2 hrs riding\n-Riding with a handlebar light and a helmet
  light is strongly encouraged.\n-Whatever tools/spares you need to make it
  back to your vehicle by 7:30pm.\n\nYou should be comfortable riding at ni
 ght and be familiar with Beaver Dam trails\, especially South Loop. Ride w
 ill be cancelled if the trail is closed due to wet/freezing trail conditio
 ns or if not enough people are signed up (3 minimum). Check torc-nc.org or
  trailforks.com for trail status. If the trail is closed the day before\, 
 the rangers will usually let us know day of if they plan on opening in tim
 e for the ride\, will post updates in the comments to trail status as nece
 ssary.\n\nPlan on being ready to roll out by 5:50pm to be back at the park
 ing lot by 7:30. Vehicles need to be out of the park by 7:45pm so the park
  rangers can lock the gates.\n\nWe usually do Outer+West+South Loops\, but
  can adjust as the group sees fit. If there are enough riders for two grou
 ps we can split up.\n\nTraffic on Creedmoor can be moving very slow around
  5pm\, please plan accordingly.\n\nPlease sign the 2026 TORC Waiver if you
  have not already. The 2026 waiver will go live after Christmas 2025. It i
 s good for the entire year of TORC events. [https://www.webscorer.com/regi
 ster?raceid=415052](https://www.webscorer.com/register?raceid=415052)
LAST-MODIFIED:20261122T144338Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://www.meetup.com/torc-nc/events/317516344/
X-SOURCE:Triangle Cycling
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Gcal Cb2Ajgfjpk6Bf9Gifg6Kg2Hn1S": "https://www.meetup.com/torc-nc/events/317420623/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_cb2ajgfjpk6bf9gifg6kg2hn1s
SUMMARY:Brumley/ River Mill Cycles night ride
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261203T173000
