DTSTAMP:20261128T073139Z
UID:event_317420623@meetup.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20261203T173000
SEQUENCE:1
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261122T144338Z
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Off Road Cyclists (TORC)\n**This a combo ride for TOR
 C and River Mill Cycles.**\n\n**Arrive at the New Hope (Main) parking lot 
 by 5:25 and be ready to roll out at 5:40.**\n\n**DST has ended and the Dar
 kness is well upon us. Everyone attending should have at least one (two is
  strongly advised) strong headlight(s) for the entirety of the ride.**\n\n
 **REQUIRED: HEADLIGHTS!! Helmet\, Familiarity with Brumley and it’s chal
 lenges. Intermediate skills and fitness (this is not a beginner ride).**\n
 \n**Make sure to sign the online waiver before you ride.**\n**https://www.
 webscorer.com/register?raceid=415052**\n\n**If the group is big enough\; w
 e'll split into 3 paced groups. 7-8 mph avg\, 9-10mph and 10+**\n\n**This 
 is not a no-drop ride\, so please be familiar with the trails. Let’s go!
 **
LAST-MODIFIED:20261122T144338Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
