X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Gcal Cb2Ajgfjpk6Bf9Gifg6Kg2Hn1S": "https://www.meetup.com/torc-nc/events/317458887/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_cb2ajgfjpk6bf9gifg6kg2hn1s
SUMMARY:Carolina North Forest Gravel + Gab
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261206T084500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261206T104500
DTSTAMP:20261128T073139Z
UID:event_317458887@meetup.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20261206T084500
SEQUENCE:1
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261122T144338Z
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Off Road Cyclists (TORC)\nGravel + Gab is an beginner
 -level\, no-drop (no one is left behind) ride from Back Alley Bikes over t
 o the gravel roads of Carolina North Forest. This ride is accessible to th
 e gravel curious to the gravel enthusiast. **We prioritize good vibes and 
 comfortable group riding** over speed and intensity.\n\n* **Distance:** 15
  miles ([route](https://ridewithgps.com/routes/54012358))\n* **Pace:** 10-
 12 mph and conversational\n* **Duration:** About 2.5 hours\n* **Meet** @8:
 45am @ [Back Alley Bikes](https://maps.app.goo.gl/Vg8FUof42TmzNb6F6)\, **W
 heels rolling** @ 9am\n* **Please fill out the [2026 TORC ride waiver](htt
 ps://www.torc-nc.org/waiver/).** You only need fill it out 1 time per year
 .\n* Helmets are required.\n* Other attire: Attire is good\, yes\, and wha
 tever floats your boat. Some of us ride in boots\, some clip in. Dress for
  the weather/conditions.\n* Water bottle/pack\, mini-tool\, spare tube/tub
 eless supplies\, and pump/CO2 highly recommended.\n* No headphones or othe
 r distractions\n* Optional coffee and pastries after the ride at [Even Dou
 gh Bakery](https://www.evendough.net/_files/ugd/25157a_c98496ddedb04409a2c
 90324cfab6a22.pdf) (subject to change day-of)\n* Message me with any quest
 ions you may have.\n\n**HOW TO HELP TORC HELP YOU:**\nIf you aren't a memb
 er of TORC please consider joining. Trails are not cheap to build or easy 
 to maintain. So much goes on behind the scenes at all the trails. If you l
 ove trails please [consider joining TORC](https://www.torc-nc.org/join-tor
 c/) to help support the work TORC does. Not ready to join? You can [donate
  to TORC](https://www.torc-nc.org/join-torc/) to support our mission at th
 e bottom of that page.
LAST-MODIFIED:20261122T144338Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://www.meetup.com/torc-nc/events/317458887/
X-SOURCE:Triangle Cycling
END:VEVENT
