SUMMARY:Winter in the Garden Craft Market
DESCRIPTION:Join us in Reeves Auditorium at the Main Garden for an afternoon of local crafts! From jewelry and ceramics to honey and crocheted goods\, there’s a little something for everyone. \nThis year’s vendors include: \n\nShannon Hathaway – quilted bags & wall hangings\nMichelle Fairholm – ceramics\nNew South Pattern House – block prints\, cards\, and bookmarks\nPflora Metal Arts – jewelry with a botanical twist\nSheri Gant – honey and beeswax products\, hand-spun yarn\, pottery\nDeerwood Studio – North Carolina nature cards and prints\nJosh Belin – woodworking\nLynn Flowers – crochet hats\nAmy Jo Gelber – ceramic critters\nLo and Behold Naturals – body products\nElise Shawen – crocheted critters\nChellie LaPointe – ceramics\nSpeedwell Jewelry – contemporary jewelry\n\nAdmission and parking are both free\, so come out and see us to support some wonderful local artisans!
URL:https://ncbg.unc.edu/event/winter-craft-market/
LOCATION:North Carolina Botanical Garden\, 100 Old Mason Farm Road\, Chapel Hill\, NC\, 27517\, United States
CATEGORIES:Special Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncbg.unc.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/963/2026/11/120323_0284-scaled.jpg
