 serts.   A costumed doctor from the mid-nineteenth century will discuss an
 tebellum medicine in the plantation hospital. For younger audiences\, joll
 y Saint Nicholas will appear 2:00-3:30 p.m.  There will be horse and cart 
 rides offered throughout the event .Free Event: Donations are welcomed. Pl
 ease Note: The Collins House will remain closed due to ongoing constructio
 n
