DESCRIPTION:Connect. Grow. Lead. SERVE! Open Table Ministry: Serving Our N
 eighbors\, Building Community Tuesday\, December 8\, 2026 | 8:45 am – 11
 :30 am Connection is powerful. Growth is intentional. Leadership is action
 . And service brings it all together. Join the Greater Durham Chamber of C
 ommerce for Connect. Grow. Lead. SERVE!\, an opportunity designed to bring
  Chamber members together outside of the traditional networking environmen
 t to build relationships\, develop as leaders\, and make a meaningful diff
 erence in our community. For this Connect. Grow. Lead. SERVE! experience\,
  we're partnering with Open Table Ministry to support their weekly Free St
 ore\, a program that provides essential resources to neighbors in our comm
 unity while creating a welcoming space where everyone is treated with dign
 ity and care. This is more than just a volunteer opportunity. It's a chanc
 e to connect with fellow Chamber members\, meet our neighbors\, hear their
  stories\, and experience firsthand the power of showing up for
