SUMMARY:*VIRTUAL* SF/F Group
DESCRIPTION:Durham Writers Group\n**Zoom Info Below Description**\n\nThis 
 sub-group focuses on Science Fiction and Fantasy\, so if you have anything
  that falls under that category — be it short story\, poem\, novel-in-pr
 ogress or screenplay — then come! We'd love to hear from you.\n\nOur for
 mat allows each reader 15 minutes to present their work... followed by app
 roximately 20 minutes of feedback from the other attendees. To ensure a fa
 ir opportunity to respond\, each attendee is limited to 1 minute of feedba
 ck time. (We usually get through three readers.)\n\nIf a reader elects to 
 post their work in advance (NOT a requirement!)\, members will be able to 
 access that work at our Google Group:\nhttps://groups.google.com/d/forum/d
 urham-sff-writers-group\n\nWe ask all members to provide a warning\, both 
 on the Google Group and during the meeting\, if their story features conte
 nt that some readers might find upsetting. This includes descriptions of s
 exual violence.\n\nReaders are: 12/8\n• Milbre\n• Raj\n• Allegra\nBa
 ckup Readers are: 12/22\n• Fraser\n• Hassan\n• Naveed\nDeep Backup: 
 1/5/27\nNoah\n\n***\n\n***We meet every Tuesday at the same time\, but alt
 ernate between meeting In-Person and on Zoom. Members may attend both form
 ats\, if desired\, but readers will be listed separately under the In-Pers
 on or Zoom weeks.***\n\n> Enabled for both audio and video. Users can choo
 se what to share.\n> Users can share their screen/application\, which coul
 d be good for reading along.\n> There is a shareable whiteboard.\n> Users 
 can annotate the screen.\n> You can set up polls (host only?).\n\nJoin Zoo
 m Meeting\n[https://us02web.zoom.us/j/81691827858?pwd=klZQya0UmbCjYHPnjbiT
 V3uIPS5ulg.1](https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fus02web.zoom.us%2
 Fj%2F81691827858%3Fpwd%3DklZQya0UmbCjYHPnjbiTV3uIPS5ulg.1&sa=D&source=cale
 ndar&ust=1777911660000000&usg=AOvVaw0K3t6Pl7xCXBU6EwFwranp)\n\nMeeting ID:
  816 9182 7858\nPasscode: 004234\n\nDial by your location\n+13017158592\,\
 ,81691827858#\,\,\,\,\\*004234# US (Washington DC)\n\n+13052241968\,\,8169
 1827858#\,\,\,\,\\*004234# US\n\nJoin by SIP\n• [81691827858@zoomcrc.com
 ](mailto:81691827858@zoomcrc.com)\n\nJoin by H.323\n162.255.36.11 (US East
 )
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/dwg-writers/events/317489401/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
