DESCRIPTION:Come one\, come all to relax and color with crayons! Coloring p
 ages of the various flora & fauna of Eno River State Park will be provided
  along with coloring tools. Coloring pages not your thing? We’ll have bl
 ank pieces of paper\, too!\n\nAll children must be accompanied by an adult
 . Please be sure to dress appropriately for the weather and bring water!\n
 \nSpaces are limited\, and registration is required. To sign up\, call (98
 4) 250-1370 or email eno.river@ncparks.gov. Include the number of guests i
 n your party and a phone number where you can be reached if the event is c
 hanged or canceled.
