SUMMARY:Holiday Potluck Party
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261213T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261213T200000
DTSTAMP:20261128T073139Z
UID:event_317206770@meetup.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20261213T163000
SEQUENCE:1
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261122T144323Z
DESCRIPTION:Team On Draft - Road Cycling\nCome out and join us for On Draf
 t's annual holiday potluck!\n\nWe've reserved the Glass Jug's atrium space
  to the right of the bar from 4:30 to 8. Please feel free to come earlier\
 , just be aware that we won't be able to set up tables or food dishes in t
 here until 4:30.\n\nPlease bring a food item if you can\, but that is not 
 a requirement. Once you know what you're bringing\, you can leave a commen
 t below so others can avoid duplication.\n\nPlates\, bowls\, utensils\, an
 d napkins\, will be provided. We'll also have tables and electricity outle
 ts for you to plug in your crock pot or warmer. All the supplies are being
  purchased with team funds. Of course we welcome further donations to thos
 e funds via Meetup.\n\nOnce again\, Bagley is buying a beer for the most o
 utlandish Christmas sweater!
LAST-MODIFIED:20261122T144323Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://www.meetup.com/ondraft/events/317206770/
X-SOURCE:Triangle Cycling
END:VEVENT
