SUMMARY:The Media and Democracy Project - What activists can do: Fix Media
  Now
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261214T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261214T200000
DTSTAMP:20261128T073051Z
UID:00ecusbj3ekrle9glcauue44j2@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20261214T190000
SEQUENCE:0
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260128T040126Z
DESCRIPTION:Link to join: https://www.mobilize.us/join/47485926/1:688a1547
 ef61b2763aaa1bfb91bf427569b4103404704185a440f7b9dac91e5a/\n\nJoin the Medi
 a and Democracy Project to better understand and respond to the factors th
 at influence public opinion\, voters and democracy. Each session we will a
 ctivate on a current information-related subject to help Fix Media Now. \n
 \nWe develop and distribute skills to navigate the Information War on trut
 h and democracy. \n\nWe are a non-partisan all volunteer group that engage
 s in actions to directly improve the quality of public information such as
  messaging\, fighting disinformation\, engaging in media accountability an
 d in growing support for local journalism. \n\nWe see journalists and the 
 media as accountable allies essential for an informed democracy\, counteri
 ng dangerous disinformation and propaganda and promoting the common good.\
 n\nHow to prepare:\nBring a friend - send them the link. \nActivate your s
 ocial networks.\n\nhttps://www.mobilize.us/mediademocracyproject/event/430
 177/
LAST-MODIFIED:20260128T040126Z
LOCATION:Virtual event
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Durham Resistance (Virtual US)
END:VEVENT
