SUMMARY:Tour: A Closer Look at One Work of Art
DESCRIPTION:Look closely and carefully at a single work of art\, guided by Lilly Rodriguez\, head of interpretive resources. Today’s tour will focus on Fragment of a Funeral Urn (Lekythos) with Leave-Taking Scene (76.24.1). \nFree\, but space is limited to 20 participants; first come\, first served. \nThis event is part of UNC–Chapel Hill’s Campus Life Experience (CLE) program. Students who attend can scan the QR code provided at the event to receive CLE credit.
