 e accompanied by an adult. Please be sure to dress appropriately for the w
 eather and bring water!\n\nSpaces are limited\, and registration is requir
 ed. To sign up\, call (984) 250-1370 or email eno.river@ncparks.gov. Inclu
 de the number of guests in your party and a phone number where you can be 
 reached if the event is changed or canceled.
