DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the holiday season with a festive adventure at Jones 
 Lake State Park! Explore our Holiday Trail\, where forest animals dressed 
 for the season are waiting to share clues to help you discover hidden Jone
 s Lake ceramic candy canes. Find a candy cane\, and it's yours to keep. Br
 ing the family and enjoy a little holiday magic in the great outdoors! Par
 ticipants should go to the visitor center to receive scavenger hunt sheet 
 before getting started.
