DESCRIPTION:The New Hope Bird Alliance and the Chapel Hill Bird Club are j
 oining together to offer all our members an MLK weekend choice of field tr
 ips\, <span><span>January 16-18\, 2027</span></span>. NHBA will be travel
 ing to the NC Outer Banks\, while CHBC will go to the Huntington Beach S
 tate Park in South Carolina.<b><i> Both trips are now wait list only. Ple
 ase contact the relevant trip leader if you wish to be added to the list.<
 /i></b><br><br>Our expert trip leaders help you explore the best birding h
 ot spots in both venues. For the CHBC trip\, preference will be given to m
 embers. Just send an email to David Anderson at <span><span><span><a href
 ="mailto:d47anders@gmail.com" target="_blank">d47anders@gmail.com</a></spa
 n></span></span> for the Outer Banks\, or to Bo Howes at <span><span><sp
 an><a href="mailto:bohowes@gmail.com" target="_blank">bohowes@gmail.com</a
 ></span></span></span> for Huntington Beach. We are asking a donation of 
 $75 for either trip. <br><br>We are offering a couple of scholarships for
  students or others who need help with funds for the trips. For questions\
 , please contact David Anderson at <span><span><span><span><a href="mailt
 o:d47anders@gmail.com" target="_blank">d47anders@gmail.com</a></span></spa
 n></span></span> or Bo Howes at <span><span><span><a href="mailto:bohowe
 s@gmail.com" target="_blank">bohowes@gmail.com</a></span></span></span>.
LAST-MODIFIED:20261115T195326Z
