BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Ncbg": "https://ncbg.unc.edu/event/schools-out-camp-winter-wonders/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:ncbg
X-SOURCE:NC Botanical Garden
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270119T084500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270119T151500
DTSTAMP:20261123T180530Z
CREATED:20261123T180530Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261123T180530Z
UID:10000899-1800348300-1800371700@ncbg.unc.edu
SUMMARY:School's Out Camp: Winter Wonders ❄️
DESCRIPTION:Winter transforms the landscape\, but life doesn’t stop! Campers will explore the clever ways native plants and animals survive the cold\, then head outside as nature detectives to search for the signs and secrets of winter life. \nDesigned for young nature enthusiasts and led by our experienced educators\, our School’s Out Camps offer the perfect blend of outdoor exploration\, wildlife discovery\, and creative activities in a small-group setting. Kids enjoy a mix of indoor and outdoor learning experiences and loads of fun. \nDrop-off: 8:45-9:00 AM\, Pickup: 3:00-3:15 PM \nExtend the day with optional aftercare from 3–5 PM for additional fee ($20) \nChild-to-staff ratio of 1:7. \nCampers bring their own snack\, water bottle\, and lunch. \nFor grades 1-3 \nSpace is limited\, so reserve your child’s spot today \nRegister here!
URL:https://ncbg.unc.edu/event/schools-out-camp-winter-wonders/
LOCATION:North Carolina Botanical Garden\, 100 Old Mason Farm Road\, Chapel Hill\, NC\, 27517\, United States
CATEGORIES:Special Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncbg.unc.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/963/2026/11/PXL_20261103_155229648-scaled.jpg
