DESCRIPTION:Session description Some conversations matter more than others
 : giving or receiving feedback\, raising a concern\, pushing back\, or res
 olving tension. Avoiding them costs trust\, time\, and good people. In thi
 s practical session\, you'll learn how to prepare\, what to say (and avoid
 ) when friction starts to build\, and how to recover when things go sidewa
 ys. You'll leave with simple tools you can use in your very next conversat
 ion. Ideal for business owners\, managers\, employees\, and anyone who wan
 ts to communicate with more confidence at work. Melissa Williard is the fo
 under of Treasured Revelations and an ICF-credentialed coach and Leadershi
 p Development Facilitator. During 20+ years at a growing Raleigh-based com
 pany\, she spent 15 in leadership\, including the last 5 on the senior lea
 dership team. Along the way\, she envisioned\, designed\, and led multiple
  leadership and staff training programs\, and navigated plenty of conversa
 tions that mattered: with employees\, peers\, and executives. Her foc
LOCATION:Wake Forest\, NC
URL:https://chambermaster.wakeforestchamber.org/events/details/wba-clear-c
 alm-and-courageous-navigating-conversations-that-matter
